{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2266","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. AND, OR, Sort!"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"binary string"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^{\\text{∗}}$$$ $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You may perform the following operation any number of times (possibly zero):"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" choose an integer $$$i$$$ ($$$1 \\le i \\le n$$$), and replace $$$s_i$$$ with either the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#AND"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise AND"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" or the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#OR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise OR"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" of $$$s_1, s_2, \\ldots, s_i$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that the bitwise AND or bitwise OR of a single element is equal to the element itself."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your goal is to make $$$s$$$ sorted in non-decreasing order$$$^{\\text{†}}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Find the minimum number of operations required to sort $$$s$$$ in non-decreasing order."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^{\\text{∗}}$$$A binary string only contains characters $$$\\texttt{0}$$$ and $$$\\texttt{1}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^{\\text{†}}$$$If $$$s$$$ is in non-decreasing order, then $$$s_1 \\leq s_2 \\leq \\ldots \\leq s_n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the length of the binary string $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains the binary string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$. Each character of $$$s$$$ is either "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print a single integer — the minimum number of operations required to sort $$$s$$$ in non-decreasing order."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n4\n0011\n4\n1000\n5\n01000\n8\n01001101\n7\n0101010\n7\n0111101\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n3\n1\n2\n3\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, the string is already sorted, so no operations are required."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, we can use bitwise OR to change the last three characters to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", obtaining "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1111"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in $$$3$$$ operations."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"2266C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2266/problem/C"}